CHAPTER.VERS:
Hear, you

          {+}
         peoples, all of you

          {+}
        : listen, O earth, and all that is in it: and let the Sovereign Yahweh be witness against you

          {+}
        , the Lord from his holy temple.

Pass by, O inhabitant of Shaphir, in nakedness and shame: the inhabitant of Zaanan has not come forth; the wailing of Beth-ezel will take from you

          {+}
         its standing ground.
